    permission to reuse them. Screenshots of team projects, such as Moneywell Town, belong to those
    projects. The site's source code is published in its
    <a href="https://github.com/AkshayReddyGujjula/AkshayReddyGujjula">GitHub repository</a> under
    the licence stated there.
  </p>

  <h2>The contact form</h2>
  <p>
    Please use it for genuine messages. Don't send anything unlawful, abusive or automated. I may
